      "content": "ok so if i lower the ttl next time it'll be faster, i get that. but it still feels weird that it's so inconsistent. sometimes it's fast and sometimes it feels like the data is just... hiding. like it's there but you just can't find it. is there any way to force it to update or is it just out of my hands?",
